[[File:Fed Upon ingame.png|thumb|right|Elder siphon skill and Fed Upon status icon. Note that the Ring of Death is not part of the siphon skill.]]

'''Fed Upon''' is a [[debuff]] that deals [[physical]] [[damage over time]]. It is inflicted by [[the Elder]]'s siphon and super siphon skills. It is paired with two more debuffs named [[Sprouting Madness]] and [[Crystalised Fear]] respectively.

In both skills, Elder will first either slow the player character or completely freeze them, by applying [[Sprouting Madness]] or [[Crystalised Fear]]. In both cases [[the Elder]] will cast a fan-shaped [[Area of effect|Area of Effect]], in which the player takes [[physical]] [[damage over time]]. '''Fed Upon''' can be dealt with by wearing a pair of {{il|Kaom's Roots}}, which makes the player unaffected by [[Sprouting Madness]]. However [[Kaom's Roots]] does not negate [[Crystalised Fear]].

The [[Physical damage|physical]] [[damage over time]] coming from '''Fed Upon''' can of course be dealt with by high [[Regeneration]], good mitigation or various other means.

